<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Linger - SiriusXM Session</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Royel Otis</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Linger / Heading For The Door (Sirius XM Session)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2dono2Koz7DEvGwxUsmMLq</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.500" end="00:26.500">If you, if you could return, don't let it burn, don't let it fade</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.100" end="00:31.560">I'm sure I might be rude but it's just your attitude</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.560" end="00:37.780">That it's tearing me apart and it's ruining everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.780" end="00:45.080">I swore, I swore I would be true and honey, so did you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.080" end="00:48.520">So why were you holding her hand?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.520" end="00:51.020">Is just the way we stand?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.020" end="00:53.770">Were you lying all the time?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.770" end="00:55.460">Was it just a game to you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.460" end="01:00.240">But I'm in so deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.240" end="01:05.060">You know I'm such a fool for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.060" end="01:10.010">You've got me wrapped around your finger</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.010" end="01:12.670">Do you have to let it linger?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.670" end="01:19.480">Do you have to, do you have to, do you have to let it linger?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.480" end="01:25.870">Oh, I thought the world of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.870" end="01:30.250">I thought nothing could go wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.250" end="01:36.230">But I was wrong, I was wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.230" end="01:40.350">If you, if you could get by</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.350" end="01:43.110">Trying not to lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.110" end="01:47.190">Those things wouldn't be so confused</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.190" end="01:49.340">And I wouldn't feel so used</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.340" end="01:52.100">But you always really knew</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.100" end="01:54.230">I just want to be with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.230" end="01:58.590">And I'm in so deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.590" end="02:03.710">You know I'm such a fool for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.710" end="02:08.760">You've got me wrapped around your finger</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.760" end="02:11.460">Do you have to let it linger?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.460" end="02:18.470">Do you have to, do you have to, do you have to let it linger?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.470" end="02:23.430">You know I'm such a fool for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.430" end="02:28.360">You've got me wrapped around your finger</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.360" end="02:31.040">Do you have to let it linger?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.040" end="02:36.220">Do you have to, do you have to, do you have to let it linger?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.220" end="02:40.220" /></div></body></tt>